baru saja memikirkan sesuatu.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.380
Napi pasti bertato.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:59.570
Walton bilang napi itu memukuli penato

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.140
